# Release Relay pipeline files: version 12
# Extra files Release Relay should never deploy or delete, added to its built-in list. The built-in list
# (BUILT_IN_EXCLUDES in scripts/release-relay.js) names Release Relay's own components exactly, so your own
# classes are deployed even when their names start with "Rly". Runs with {"selfUpdate":true} (the hub updating
# itself from the release-relay-hub branch) ignore both lists.
#
# One glob per line, relative to SOURCE_PATH (force-app/main/default). * matches within a folder name, ** across
# folders, ? one character. A glob that matches a folder covers everything in it. # starts a comment.
# "only-labels:<glob>" after a labels file excludes it only when every label in it matches.
# The pipeline reads this file from its own commit (the default branch), never from a release branch.
